==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 & 2'''===
To kill Hyppoh, use [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]. Not that difficult of a stage all in all.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Buffed Celeboodles and Mistress Celeboodles are present in this stage. Since they can almost 1 shot even the mighty [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]], you may need to bring multiple cheap meatshields to stall them. Start by saving some money. After the Celeboodles spawned, spam the cheap meatshields along with [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] (32) to kill them with powerful area damage while being protected by meatshields. Proceed to stack them, once Mistress Celeboodles starts spawning, just do the same thing. Don't forget to collect anti unstarred alien treasures from chapter 1 and 2 to make this stage easier. If you still struggles in this stage THAT bad then bring [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] aswell.

If you still can't beat the stage, try collecting more [[Treasure]]s from [[Empire of Cats]]. More meatshields could also be a solution.

